<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: You good?\rYour homies hurt and tired.\nHere, give ’em some of my medicine.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let’s go hard\nfor the homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let’s go hard\nfor the homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ariana: HOLD UP, sweetie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ariana: Lil baby, who told you you\ncould run around doin’ WHATEVER?\rYou been embarrassin’ The Feds\nfor WEEKS. Our stock is in the TOILET.\r...So I’m finna shut you down. No\nmatter how hard you think you is, two\fof us on you at once? You CHOOSIN’\fviolence. Don’t you agree?\rHee hee hee! It’s nothin’ personal,\nsweetie. Just business. Run it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: Hold up!\rA two-on-one scrap?\nThat’s mad unfair!\rTypical Feds, bein’ sneaky.\nLemme jump in!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ariana: Oh, you brought a GROWN MAN?\nWhere your dignity at, sweetie?\rI’m the ACTING Big Boss while\nGiovanni on vacation!\fI’m finna show y’all what happen\fwhen you play with The Feds!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tch, okay, you nice.\nThat’s annoyin’.\rIf you joined The Feds, you\ncould make Executive. Dental.\fVision. A company car. Think about it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ariana: But whatever. The broadcast\nexperiment was a W anyway.\rI don’t even care about this\nhideout no more. It was a SUBLET.\rWe got WAY bigger plans, sweetie.\nY’all gon’ see the Feds’\freal power real soon.\rEnjoy it while it last...\nHee hee hee...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: That’s it. We beat every\nFed in here.\rBut I’m worried about the young guy\nwith red hair I scrapped on\fthe way...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. You was doin’\nso good, I just hung back.\rNow all that’s left is to shut\noff that weird radio signal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. You was doin’\nso good, I just hung back.\rNow all that’s left is to shut\noff that weird radio signal.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This machine causin’ all the\nproblems. I don’t see no switch...\rWe got no choice. We gotta make all\nthe ELECTRODE faint.\rThat should stop this machine from\nsendin’ that weird signal.\rIt ain’t the ELECTRODE’s fault,\nso it make me sad.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let’s split it up.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This machine causin’ all the\nproblems. I don’t see no switch...\rWe got no choice. We gotta make all\nthe ELECTRODE faint.\rThat should stop this machine from\nsendin’ that weird signal.\rIt ain’t the ELECTRODE’s fault,\nso it make me sad.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let’s split it up.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: I got this side.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: That weird signal finally\nstopped. The lake should go back to\fnormal. You the best!\rLemme say good looks for all the\nhomies. Oh, yeah. Take this.\rI found it here, but I ain’t\ngot no use for it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got HM05 from Lance!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: That’s Jacuzzi.\rTeach it to a homie to get across\nwild water. But remember this.\rYou can only use it outside of battle\nwith the Chain from Mahogany Block.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\rThe road to bein’ the Big League\nKingpin is long and hard.\rKnowin’ that, you gon’ keep goin’?\r..................\rI see. Nah, you right.\rIf you’d give up that easy,\nyou never woulda chased that\fdream in the first place.\rCan’t wait to see you again!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\rThe road to bein’ the Big League\nKingpin is long and hard.\rKnowin’ that, you gon’ keep goin’?\r..................\rI see. Nah, you right.\rIf you’d give up that easy,\nyou never woulda chased that\fdream in the first place.\rCan’t wait to see you again!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“The Radio Transmitter”\rLooks like this door check the\nvoice of whoever say the password\fbefore it open...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The door closed...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} said the password.\rThe door opened!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s the radio transmitter sendin’\nthe evil signal.\rIt’s runnin’ full blast.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The radio transmitter finally\nstopped its evil broadcast.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW: The password is...\fIn Giovanni We Trust. Caw.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW: The password is...\fIn Giovanni We Trust. Caw.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW: The password is...\fIn Giovanni We Trust. Caw.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0113_D35R0103_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MURKROW screamed the password\nin Petrel’s voice.\r..................\rThe voice-recognition system\nunlocked the door! Real secure, Feds.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
